on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  4] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [  6] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 30 to 1
  [  8] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 10] extcall 48 .............................. play done
  [ 12] ret
end
